OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be cloudy with a few outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain. Then the rest of the night will
OL,8,Fbe cloudy with occasional rain but
OL,9,Fsome drier spells too.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FA cloudy day with spells of
OL,12,Frain although becoming generally drier
OL,13,Fduring the afternoon. Chance of
OL,14,Ffurther rain in the evening.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,17,Fand bright for most of Thursday but
OL,18,Frain likely by evening. Overnight rain
OL,19,Fon Friday soon clearing then mainly
OL,20,Fdry and bright. Dry and bright on
OL,21,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
